# Raw third-party API dumps — bulky (TCGdex full multi-language card lists, ~13 MB)
# and reproducible with verification/fetch_full.ps1, fetch_tcgdex.ps1, jp_fetch.ps1, asia_fetch.ps1
verification/cache/

# Intermediate upscaled image crops used once to read the xm2a mirror-foil variants
verification/zoom/

# Intermediate stages of the historical Cardmarket harvest (#28). _chunk1..3.json are the captured
# result pages; _cards_stage1..3.json are what build/join/getimages hand along before finalize
# writes snorlax_cards.json. None are reproducible — the chunks are a scrape of a live marketplace
# — so they are ignored rather than committed or regenerated. Anyone who recovers a copy can drop
# it in without dirtying the tree, and analyze.ps1 will prefer it over snorlax_cards.json.
_chunk*.json
_cards_stage*.json

# Local receiver / scratch
verification/_evidence_audit.json

# Golden captures from verification/parity.py. Regenerated on demand against whatever the data
# currently is; committing them would create a second copy of the artifacts that goes stale the
# moment a verification pass runs, and a stale contract gets rubber-stamped rather than read.
verification/parity/

# Python bytecode generated by local validation
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Generated Pages artifact (rebuilt by scripts/publish.py)
_site/

# Personal collection state. The blank, reproducible template remains tracked.
snoredex-tracker.sqlite
snoredex-tracker.sqlite-shm
snoredex-tracker.sqlite-wal
